# default-secret-scan — known fixture values, allowed BY VALUE.
#
# WHY A VALUE LIST AND NOT A PATH EXEMPTION
# ------------------------------------------
# Until 2026-11-10 this gate skipped `tests/*` and every `*.test.*` by
# path. The reasoning was sound — tests assert behaviour and must be
# able to name a secret-shaped string — but the exemption was by
# DIRECTORY, so a real secret committed inside a test file was outside
# the gate's reach. The runtime audit named it: "default-secret-scan:
# exempts tests/ and every *.test.* by path".
#
# The plan says the fix: "known fake values are allowlisted by value,
# not by directory". That is what this file is.
#
# FORMAT
#   <value><TAB><why it is accepted, and when it is removed>
#
# A value without a reason is rejected by the scan: an accepted value
# with no stated reason is how an exception list becomes permanent.
#
# EACH ENTRY IS MEASURED, NOT ASSUMED
# -----------------------------------
# Every value below was checked against the service it is shaped like,
# on 2026-11-10, and the service's answer is recorded here. A fixture
# that turns out to be LIVE is a leak, not an exception.
123456:AArealoperator	Ten Telegram bot-token fixture in ten mcp-send-*.test.ts files. Measured 2026-11-10: the Bot API answers 401 Unauthorized for it, so it is dead, not merely unused.
test-passphrase-123	Vault-init fixture: the passphrase a test passes so vault init can REFUSE a non-empty value. Never a credential.
my-secret-passphrase-123	Self-modify passphrase fixture — the value the tier-2 passphrase check rejects. Never a credential.
synthetic-recovery-passphrase	Incident-bundle transfer fixture, prefixed "synthetic-" by construction.
memphis-local-stats-2026	A REAL credential that was published and has since been rotated: measured 2026-11-10, GET /api/stats.php with it answers 503 endpoint_disabled ("MEMPHIS_STATS_TOKEN is not set on this host"), so the endpoint no longer accepts it. It survives in three places as the worked example of the 2026-10-09 incident (scripts/default-secret-scan.sh header, .github/workflows/ci.yml, tests/ops/api-default-secret-contract.test.ts). Remove this entry only when those three references are gone.
